#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Root-level (non-`src/`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:51
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| `kind`      | Layer   | Purpose                                                                   |\n"
#| "| ----------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| `connect`   | Habitat RPC | `protocol: HabitatRPC/1.0`, `auth_token`                                      |\n"
#| "| `connected` | Habitat RPC | `session_id`, `heartbeat_interval_sec`                                    |\n"
#| "| `req`       | Both    | RPC (`id`, `method`, `payload`) — incl. `sap.attach`, `conversation.*`, … |\n"
#| "| `res`       | Both    | RPC response                                                              |\n"
#| "| `evt`       | Both    | Async event                                                               |\n"
msgid ""
"| Path                     | Role                                                       |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `tests/`                 | 集成测试与 helpers（非产品模块）                           |\n"
"| `scripts/`               | 构建、检查、迁移脚本                                       |\n"
"| `docs/`                  | 英文概念/指南文档（源）                                    |\n"
"| `docs/.generated/zh_CN/` | po4a 构建产物（gitignore；site 构建时从 `po/zh_CN/` 生成） |\n"
"| `messages/`              | Paraglide `en.json` / `zh-cn.json`                         |\n"
"| `po/`                    | gettext PO（恢复文档 i18n 时用）                           |\n"
"| `site/`                  | 文档站（独立 install / build）                             |\n"
msgstr ""
"| `kind`      | 层      | 用途                                                                      |\n"
"| ----------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `connect`   | Habitat RPC | `protocol: HabitatRPC/1.0`、`auth_token`                                      |\n"
"| `connected` | Habitat RPC | `session_id`、`heartbeat_interval_sec`                                    |\n"
"| `req`       | 双层    | RPC（`id`、`method`、`payload`）— 含 `sap.attach`、`conversation.*` 等    |\n"
"| `res`       | 双层    | RPC 响应                                                                  |\n"
"| `evt`       | 双层    | 异步事件                                                                  |\n"

